@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
title 001 Guided Notes - Import and Write-back Sequence (Merged Headers / Main Questions and Subitems)
actor Teacher
participant "Teacher Authorization" as Auth
participant "Guided Notes Feature" as Notes
participant "Original Google Sheets" as Sheets
participant "Activity Module" as Activity
participant "002 Course Ownership" as Courses
participant "Result Module" as Results
participant "Operation Repository / Lease" as Store
Teacher -> Notes : provide link; select one worksheet and lecture naming mode
Notes -> Auth : check teacher authorization
alt unauthorized
 Auth --> Notes : denied
 Notes --> Teacher : access denied
else authorized
 Auth --> Notes : permitted
 opt course-scoped import
  Notes -> Courses : validate teacher ownership; require available provider
  Courses --> Notes : course identity / title or deny
 end
 Notes -> Sheets : read selected worksheet
 alt inaccessible / read failure
  Sheets --> Notes : error
  Notes --> Teacher : locate error; preserve confirmed version
 else readable
  Sheets --> Notes : content plus header and data merge ranges
  Notes -> Notes : locate main-number spans, subitem labels and answer anchors
  alt duplicate / missing / ambiguous
   Notes --> Teacher : located errors; confirmation unavailable
  else valid
   Notes -> Store : persist teacher-owned ready preview and naming choice
   note over Notes,Store : Optional course identity stays in server preview and replacement previews.
   Notes --> Teacher : main question count, answer count, subitem labels and targets
   Teacher -> Notes : review detected main questions and all subitems; confirm import
   Notes -> Store : check owner and preview status
   alt preview already confirmed with same request
    Store --> Notes : same published catalog (no new version)
    Notes --> Activity : get_catalog: fixed version and ordered items
   else ready preview
    Notes -> Sheets : re-read selected worksheet outside DB transaction
    Sheets --> Notes : current source structure and values
    Notes -> Auth : recheck teacher authorization
    Auth --> Notes : permission or denial
    alt source changed or authorization lost
     Notes -> Store : invalidate changed preview; create replacement if valid
     Notes --> Teacher : confirm new preview, or access denied
    else still valid
     opt course-scoped import
      Notes -> Courses : recheck course ownership outside write transaction
      Courses --> Notes : permitted or deny
     end
     Notes -> Store : short transaction: recheck status, allocate version, persist catalog, label metadata and bindings
     Store --> Notes : one confirmed immutable catalog
     Notes --> Activity : get_catalog: fixed version and ordered items
    end
   end
  end
 end
end
== Ended activity and winning answers ==
Teacher -> Notes : request write-back preview
Notes -> Auth : check teacher authorization
alt unauthorized
 Auth --> Notes : denied
 Notes --> Teacher : access denied
else authorized
 Auth --> Notes : permitted
 Notes -> Activity : obtain activity and bound import version
 Activity --> Notes : activity identity, import version, ended state
 Notes -> Results : obtain specified result snapshot
 Results --> Notes : settled immutable snapshot, or RESULT_NOT_READY
 break activity not ended or result not settled
  Notes --> Teacher : wait for activity closure and settlement
 end
 Notes -> Notes : validate ended state, identities, set membership and same winner
 alt invalid / unfinished activity
  Notes --> Teacher : explain mismatch; no write
 else valid
  Notes -> Sheets : read current targets and content
  Sheets --> Notes : observations or access error
  alt source unavailable
   Notes --> Teacher : source error; no write
  else source accessible
   Notes -> Auth : recheck teacher authorization after source read
   Notes -> Results : recheck settled snapshot identity and contents
   break authorization or snapshot changed
    Notes --> Teacher : reject preview; no write
   end
   Notes -> Store : short transaction: save owner-bound snapshot, observations and fingerprints
   Notes --> Teacher : preview original / proposed values and differences
   note over Notes,Store
   GET of a saved preview only reads local storage.
   Preview actions describe intended changes, not completed writes.
   end note
   note over Teacher,Notes
   Skip units without a winner.
   Re-identify moved targets and confirm new preview.
   Changed main numbers or subitems require re-import.
   end note
   Teacher -> Notes : confirm preview identity
   Notes -> Auth : recheck teacher permission
   Auth --> Notes : current permission
   Notes -> Store : claim source and idempotent operation in short transaction
   Store --> Notes : owner token or existing / busy
   break claim denied or duplicate running
    Notes --> Teacher : source busy or existing operation
   end
   Notes -> Activity : recheck bound import version and ended state
   Activity --> Notes : current activity state
   Notes -> Results : recheck result version
   Results --> Notes : current result version
   Notes -> Sheets : recheck targets and observed content
   Sheets --> Notes : current observations or error
   alt authorization / source / result changed or inaccessible
    Notes -> Store : invalidate preview; release source lease
    Notes --> Teacher : invalidate preview; re-identify and confirm differences
   else preview still valid
    Notes -> Store : durably mark next unit unknown before sending; renew lease
    note over Notes,Store
    Recheck teacher / result and source before each unit.
    Stop on deadline or lease loss; keep remaining not processed.
    Unresolved physical sources cannot start unrelated attempts.
    end note
    Notes -> Sheets : one RAW batch per main question; write answer anchors only
    alt permission denied / explicit failure
     Sheets --> Notes : failed outcome
    else atomic success / timeout (outcome unknown)
     Sheets --> Notes : response or uncertain outcome
    end
    Notes -> Sheets : read back targets where possible
    Sheets --> Notes : observed values or read failure
    Notes -> Notes : classify verified / failed / not processed / unknown / skipped
    Notes -> Store : persist observed outcomes; release source lease
    Notes --> Teacher : per-item and per-set report; verify all members for completion
   end
  end
 end
end
== Recover incomplete write-back ==
Teacher -> Notes : retry incomplete operation
Notes -> Auth : recheck authorization
Auth --> Notes : permission
alt authorized
 Notes -> Store : claim recovery; pin original result snapshot
 Store --> Notes : owner token or busy
 break recovery claim denied
  Notes --> Teacher : source busy or existing operation
 end
 Notes -> Activity : recheck binding and ended state
 Activity --> Notes : current state
 Notes -> Results : recheck original result version
 Results --> Notes : current result version
 Notes -> Sheets : re-read structure and current values
 Sheets --> Notes : source structure, values or read error
 Notes -> Notes : validate semantics; reidentify current anchors
 Notes -> Notes : same answer = verified; no winner = skipped
 alt source inaccessible / main-question / subitem membership or result changed
  Notes -> Store : persist conflict or unknown; release lease
  Notes --> Teacher : explain error; re-import if necessary
 else original values or conflicts remain
  Notes -> Store : persist new recovery preview; release lease
  Notes --> Teacher : refreshed preview; identify conflicts
  Teacher -> Notes : explicitly confirm remaining writes
  ref over Teacher,Sheets
  Repeat pre-write checks, writes and read-back.
  Preserve set winner; retry incomplete members only.
  end ref
 else all applicable answers match
  Notes -> Store : persist verification; release lease
  Notes --> Teacher : verified completion without rewriting
 end
else unauthorized
 Notes --> Teacher : denied
end
@enduml

